---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: yaml/document/directive_comments.yaml
---

# Input

```yaml
%YAML 1.2 # on the first directive's line
# between the directives
%TAG ! tag:example.com,2000: # on the last directive's line
# after the directives

---
first
...
%YAML 1.2

# separated by blank lines

%TAG ! tag:example.com,2000:

---
second
...
%YAML 1.2

# after a blank line, in the last document
---
third

```


# Formatted

```yaml
%YAML 1.2 # on the first directive's line
# between the directives
%TAG ! tag:example.com,2000: # on the last directive's line
# after the directives

---
first
...
%YAML 1.2

# separated by blank lines

%TAG ! tag:example.com,2000:

---
second
...
%YAML 1.2
# after a blank line, in the last document
---
third

```
